{"method":{"methodHash":"7a5aa126f435e70ca06e92a213670d9d","typeHash":"e4a6a66cfe6c7304f91b9ce2765912cc","name":"DescribeBalanced","filePath":"/Users/pratiksinghthakur/perproj/dotnet/Aimmy/Aimmy2/AILogic/PerformanceBenchmark.cs","bodySpan":{"startLine":474,"startColumn":9,"endLine":489,"endColumn":10},"calls":[]},"lines":["        private static string DescribeBalanced(","            PerformanceBenchmarkSizeResult balanced,","            PerformanceBenchmarkSizeResult quality,","            int currentImageSize,","            bool isFixedSizeModel)","        {","            if (isFixedSizeModel)","                return \u0022Fixed model locks image size. FPS cap cuts heat without changing detection detail.\u0022;","","            if (balanced.ImageSize \u003C quality.ImageSize)","                return \u0022Keeps near-quality FPS with lower CPU/GPU load. Small or far targets can lose detail.\u0022;","","            return balanced.ImageSize \u003C currentImageSize","                ? \u0022Lower image size cuts load while keeping measured FPS close.\u0022","                : \u0022Best all-around pair from measured FPS, image size, and load.\u0022;","        }"],"startLine":474}